  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Why sitting too long causes blood clots",
      "char_file": "부종_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Your calf muscles squeeze",
        "to pump blood from your legs",
        "back up to your heart",
        "",
        "Sit too long and that pump",
        "stops — blood pools and",
        "can clot",
        "",
        "CDC: up to 900,000 Americans",
        "get a blood clot every year,",
        "and up to 100,000 die from it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Watch for these warning signs",
      "char_file": "부종_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Swelling and pain in",
        "just one leg",
        "",
        "Skin that's red or",
        "warm to the touch",
        "",
        "Sudden shortness of breath",
        "or chest pain — call 911"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "What raises your risk even more",
      "char_file": "담배_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Smoking damages vessel walls",
        "and thickens your blood",
        "",
        "Pregnancy, birth control pills,",
        "and recent surgery raise it too"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3 habits that lower your risk",
      "char_file": "의자_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Move regularly,",
        "stay hydrated,",
        "wear compression socks"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "First, move regularly",
      "char_file": "의자_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Get up and walk the aisle",
        "every hour on long trips",
        "",
        "Flex your ankles up and down",
        "even while seated"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Second, stay hydrated",
      "char_file": "물컵_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Dehydration thickens",
        "your blood, raising",
        "clot risk",
        "",
        "Skip the coffee and alcohol",
        "on long trips — drink water"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Third, wear compression socks",
      "char_file": "압박스타킹_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Knee-high compression socks",
        "push blood flow back",
        "up your legs",
        "",
        "Especially helpful for long",
        "flights or standing jobs"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "closing": {
    "headline": [
      [
        "Move often, stay hydrated,",
        "and wear compression socks"
